          "vis": "priv",
          "kind": "const",
          "name": "BORN_MODULAR",
          "text": "const BORN_MODULAR: &str = \"born modular: start per-scope — scaffold the components first, then fill them; never write one oversized file intending to split it later (the splitting is the writing), new files born over their budget gate at commit (`born-size`)\";"
